In front of school</b>

00:50:39.300 --> 00:50:41.830
I hate weak people.

00:50:41.830 --> 00:50:45.140
I don't really understand what this means.

00:50:45.720 --> 00:50:49.040
That night, I punched someone for the first time.

00:50:49.950 --> 00:50:53.500
That night, I killed someone for the first time.

00:50:55.860 --> 00:50:57.880
I haven't been able to sleep at all since that day.

00:50:58.280 --> 00:51:01.820
I'm so scared that I can't even go outside.

00:51:02.250 --> 00:51:07.180
I hate myself for living comfortably, and I can't even look at myself in the mirror.

00:51:08.400 --> 00:51:10.380
I'm the worst kind of human.

00:51:10.910 --> 00:51:15.210
I don't feel like doing anything, and I don't feel like eating anything.

00:51:15.540 --> 00:51:17.640
I'm the worst kind of human.

00:51:18.240 --> 00:51:24.700
On the seventh day, I realized that man wasn't the only one who died then.

00:51:25.310 --> 00:51:28.430
Why didn't anyone tell me the simple reality?

00:51:28.430 --> 00:51:34.750
That killing someone means killing yourself too?

00:51:36.280 --> 00:51:40.200
August. I'm slowly going crazy.

00:51:40.600 --> 00:51:42.500
It's just as Araya said.

00:51:42.500 --> 00:51:44.260
I'm perfect.

00:51:44.260 --> 00:51:48.970
You can't blame me for killing people if I'm crazy.

00:51:49.460 --> 00:51:52.080
But killing doesn't relieve me.

00:51:52.080 --> 00:51:54.100
Being alone makes me feel too anxious.

00:51:54.570 --> 00:51:59.270
I realized that I need someone just like me, a lunatic.

00:52:22.650 --> 00:52:24.160
Long time no see.

00:52:24.160 --> 00:52:26.610
It's been three years, hasn't it, Kokutou?

00:52:28.630 --> 00:52:30.890
You got here faster than I thought.

00:52:30.890 --> 00:52:35.350
I didn't think you'd get here for a while.

00:52:37.110 --> 00:52:39.580
Did I screw up somewhere?

00:52:39.940 --> 00:52:41.390
No.

00:52:41.390 --> 00:52:43.380
But there was one clue.

00:52:44.390 --> 00:52:48.530
In November, I had the opportunity to investigate the residents of a particular apartment complex.

00:52:48.910 --> 00:52:50.870
It wasn't an ordinary apartment complex.

00:52:51.230 --> 00:52:55.990
You were there, so you had to be connected with Shiki in some way.

00:52:57.110 --> 00:52:59.750
Right, Lio Shirazumi?

00:53:01.410 --> 00:53:05.360
Araya's trick was so uninteresting.

00:53:07.250 --> 00:53:10.650
Sounds like you know everything.

00:53:10.650 --> 00:53:13.530
Yeah, it happened three years ago.

00:53:14.130 --> 00:53:19.320
It wasn't a coincidence that we met while you were on your way to Ryougi's house.

00:53:19.320 --> 00:53:25.000
I stopped you on the way because I wanted to let you see one of her murder scenes.

00:53:25.720 --> 00:53:31.000
I couldn't bear for you to be her victim without letting you know of her true nature.

00:53:32.560 --> 00:53:36.640
You're resuming the crimes from four years ago.

00:53:40.870 --> 00:53:44.920
But I wasn't the serial killer four years ago.

00:53:45.320 --> 00:53:46.720
That was Shiki Ryougi's...

00:53:46.720 --> 00:53:49.200
You're lying, Shirazumi.

00:53:54.040 --> 00:53:57.640
Is this what you wanted to do?

00:54:00.340 --> 00:54:01.210
Shirazumi...

00:54:02.940 --> 00:54:04.230
That arm...

00:54:04.960 --> 00:54:07.320
Shiki Ryougi did this to me.

00:54:17.640 --> 00:54:22.970
I thought losing an arm was no big deal, but it's taking a while to heal.

00:54:22.970 --> 00:54:26.190
I guess this is what it means to kill something.

00:54:26.190 --> 00:54:30.850
Shirazumi, why have you committed so many murders?

00:54:30.850 --> 00:54:34.190
It's not like I kill because I want to.

00:54:34.190 --> 00:54:35.750
Then why?

00:54:35.750 --> 00:54:42.540
It's because my origin was awakened by a devil with a human face named Souren Araya.

00:54:42.880 --> 00:54:48.590
Kokutou, my origin is consumption.

00:54:48.930 --> 00:54:52.990
Since my origin has been awakened, I have to consume.

00:54:53.440 --> 00:54:56.920
I'm a homicidal maniac who consumes people.

00:54:56.920 --> 00:54:59.380
Shirazumi, are you all right?

00:54:59.380 --> 00:55:00.720
You're not acting normal.

00:55:01.040 --> 00:55:03.850
Don't worry about it. Let me continue.

00:55:04.510 --> 00:55:08.660
This may be my last proper conversation.

00:55:09.570 --> 00:55:14.060
I need her, Ryougi the murderer, but you...

00:55:14.910 --> 00:55:21.450
Because you exist, Ryougi won't come to my world.

00:55:21.930 --> 00:55:24.620
The only thing I have is her, but...

00:55:24.620 --> 00:55:25.580
Shirazumi.

00:55:28.200 --> 00:55:30.100
Let's go to Touko's.

00:55:30.100 --> 00:55:32.790
She may be able to do someth-

00:55:35.110 --> 00:55:38.140
No. I'm special.

00:55:38.830 --> 00:55:40.550
But at this rate...

00:55:42.770 --> 00:55:44.680
You're kind.

00:55:45.670 --> 00:55:46.600
That's right.

00:55:47.940 --> 00:55:51.790
You were always on my side.

00:55:52.160 --> 00:55:58.030
It must be because of you that I'm able to control myself right now.

00:56:01.380 --> 00:56:03.770
I'm a murderer.

00:56:06.820 --> 00:56:09.360
I'm not normal.

00:56:09.360 --> 00:56:11.470
Please don't say that.

00:56:12.250 --> 00:56:14.960
I'm helpless.

00:56:15.430 --> 00:56:18.180
As long as you're alive, that's not true.

00:56:28.030 --> 00:56:30.540
Don't look for me anymore.

00:56:31.860 --> 00:56:34.070
I'll have to kill you next time.

00:56:36.130 --> 00:56:36.650
Shirazumi!

00:56:45.020 --> 00:56:49.170
Please Touko, you're the only one who can save him.

00:56:49.650 --> 00:56:52.160
You're always so compassionate.

00:56:52.160 --> 00:56:55.800
There's a place I wanted to check out, but I'll go back to your place now instead.

00:56:55.800 --> 00:56:57.330
Please hear me out.

00:56:57.330 --> 00:56:58.930
I think it's impossible.

00:56:58.930 --> 00:56:59.990
Bye.

00:58:37.390 --> 00:58:38.360
Hello?

00:58:42.610 --> 00:58:45.160
Shiki, right?

00:58:48.680 --> 00:58:50.440
You idiot.

00:58:51.440 --> 00:58:54.360
Where have you been?

00:58:54.360 --> 00:58:56.880
You know that it's dangerous outside, right?

00:58:59.390 --> 00:59:01.620
No, whatever. As long as you're okay.

00:59:02.070 --> 00:59:04.820
Stay at Touko's place for a while.

00:59:04.820 --> 00:59:06.340
That's all.

00:59:06.340 --> 00:59:08.420
Shiki, where are you?

00:59:09.540 --> 00:59:11.350
That's none of your business.

00:59:11.350 --> 00:59:12.810
It is my business.

00:59:12.810 --> 00:59:15.140
You're going after the killer, right?

00:59:16.160 --> 00:59:17.190
Yes.

00:59:17.720 --> 00:59:20.480
No Shiki, come back home.

00:59:20.860 --> 00:59:24.280
You shouldn't kill him.

00:59:30.190 --> 00:59:32.010
I shouldn't kill?

00:59:33.970 --> 00:59:37.270
We may barely be able to save him right now.

00:59:37.270 --> 00:59:38.460
So please find him and...

00:59:38.960 --> 00:59:42.210
You met Shirazumi?

00:59:42.470 --> 00:59:43.430
Yes.

00:59:44.230 --> 00:59:47.460
Find him? Are you insane?

00:59:50.620 --> 00:59:53.100
I see. What should I do?

00:59:53.100 --> 00:59:55.480
I have no reason to forgive him now.

00:59:55.830 --> 00:59:56.700
Shiki.

00:59:57.050 --> 00:59:58.700
No, you shouldn't kill him.

00:59:58.700 --> 01:00:00.240
I refuse.

01:00:00.240 --> 01:00:03.090
I have no intention of letting my prey get away.

01:00:03.090 --> 01:00:06.500
He's a screwed up opponent who I haven't seen for a while.

01:00:06.500 --> 01:00:08.750
But... But still.

01:00:08.750 --> 01:00:13.490
No matter how many crimes he's committed, murder is still the wrong thing to do.

01:00:14.460 --> 01:00:17.790
I'm tired of hearing your generalization, Kokutou.

01:00:19.020 --> 01:00:21.390
Lio Shirazumi has killed far too many.

01:00:21.390 --> 01:00:22.090
So...

01:00:22.090 --> 01:00:24.280
There's no one who deserves to be killed.

01:00:25.160 --> 01:00:27.010
It's too late for him.

01:00:27.010 --> 01:00:28.160
He's abnormal.

01:00:29.550 --> 01:00:32.640
Anyway, Shiki, come back home.

01:00:41.160 --> 01:00:41.860
Shiki!

01:00:49.910 --> 01:00:50.830
Shiki.

01:00:51.530 --> 01:00:53.220
If you kill Shirazumi...

01:00:53.650 --> 01:00:55.850
I won't forgive you.

01:01:02.520 --> 01:01:04.940
Sorry, I have to.

01:01:06.540 --> 01:01:07.790
Why?

01:01:09.210 --> 01:01:12.140
Because I'm a homicidal maniac, just like him.

01:01:12.800 --> 01:01:14.360
You're different.

01:01:14.710 --> 01:01:16.970
I mean, you haven't even killed anyone.

01:01:17.270 --> 01:01:19.820
I haven't killed anyone yet because I keep getting lucky.

01:01:20.970 --> 01:01:22.850
But that doesn't change the fact.

01:01:22.850 --> 01:01:24.650
I've realized something, Mikiya.

01:01:25.770 --> 01:01:29.560
Four years ago, I was close to murder.

01:01:29.560 --> 01:01:32.630
Because SHIKI was a personality that only knew of murder.

01:01:34.670 --> 01:01:36.600
But that's it.

01:01:36.600 --> 01:01:41.560
SHIKI only knew of murder, but it didn't mean that he liked murder.

01:01:42.220 --> 01:01:47.590
Ever since SHIKI died, I've been yearning for murder even though he doesn't exist anymore.

01:01:48.450 --> 01:01:55.970
Ultimately, the one who wanted to kill wasn't the SHIKI who died, but the Shiki who survived.

01:01:56.680 --> 01:02:00.410
So I can't... I can't go back home.

01:02:02.440 --> 01:02:06.730
You don't need to wait for me.

01:02:09.740 --> 01:02:12.740
That's your misunderstanding, Shiki.

01:02:13.410 --> 01:02:18.480
You said before that someone can only stand to kill one person in their life.

01:02:19.480 --> 01:02:25.000
You value this belief, and most importantly, you know the pain of murder more than anyone.

01:02:26.250 --> 01:02:28.460
You won't kill anyone.

01:02:28.460 --> 01:02:31.010
You haven't killed anyone yet because you keep getting lucky?

01:02:31.300 --> 01:02:32.910
Don't make me laugh!

01:02:32.910 --> 01:02:35.510
That luck should've run out by now.

01:02:36.990 --> 01:02:40.160
You've always chosen to suppress that urge.

01:02:40.480 --> 01:02:42.630
People have different preferences.

01:02:42.630 --> 01:02:45.920
It's just that yours happens to be murder.

01:02:47.360 --> 01:02:55.930
You told me last summer at Broad Bridge that your urge to kill wasn't as bad as you thought.

01:02:56.380 --> 01:03:00.150
I was convinced because I saw your smile when you said that.

01:03:00.730 --> 01:03:02.750
You won't kill anyone.

01:03:02.750 --> 01:03:05.870
You've resisted it until now, so you should be able to in the future.

01:03:06.210 --> 01:03:07.380
I'm sure of it!

01:03:11.460 --> 01:03:13.180
What do you mean by "you're sure"?

01:03:13.880 --> 01:03:18.890
How do you know something I don't, Kokutou?!

01:03:25.790 --> 01:03:26.740
Because...

01:03:28.360 --> 01:03:30.150
You're kind.

01:03:39.930 --> 01:03:41.780
You never change.

01:03:42.380 --> 01:03:43.400
I told you, right?

01:03:43.820 --> 01:03:48.440
I hate that part of you.

01:03:49.520 --> 01:03:51.840
Shiki, no, I-

01:04:24.260 --> 01:04:25.080
<i>Because...</i>

01:04:26.260 --> 01:04:28.010
<i>You're kind.</i>

01:04:29.360 --> 01:04:30.620
What...

01:04:32.620 --> 01:04:34.670
...a blessed man...

01:04:38.730 --> 01:04:41.220
One with awakened origin?

01:04:41.650 --> 01:04:45.220
Araya left such a dull parting gift.

01:04:46.450 --> 01:04:48.980
What is this origin?

01:04:56.680 --> 01:04:59.150
Do you believe that you had a previous life?

01:05:00.530 --> 01:05:02.970
I won't deny it, but won't affirm it either.

01:05:04.420 --> 01:05:09.080
If you remove the concept of spirit, souls, and life,

01:05:09.080 --> 01:05:11.880
everything has been reincarnated into something else.

01:05:12.560 --> 01:05:16.080
The previous life of your previous life, and the one before that.

01:05:16.080 --> 01:05:20.960
Use the disordered principle to follow your continuous string of existences

01:05:21.290 --> 01:05:23.510
back to the starting point of your soul.

01:05:24.040 --> 01:05:28.180
There exists a place where your existence started.

01:05:29.900 --> 01:05:35.360
But life doesn't exist at that place.

01:05:37.200 --> 01:05:39.910
The only thing there is the starting factor.

01:05:40.290 --> 01:05:43.200
It's only a direction that determines things.

01:05:44.160 --> 01:05:48.470
This chaotic impulse is what magi call origin.

01:05:48.850 --> 01:05:51.710
Simply put, it's your instincts.

01:05:52.550 --> 01:05:58.320
But the origin is only a factor, and not something that takes control of someone.

01:05:58.650 --> 01:06:02.120
As long as you don't somehow become aware of it.

01:06:02.120 --> 01:06:06.600
So you lose against that directionality once you're conscious of it?

01:06:06.600 --> 01:06:10.640
Lio Shirazumi can only repeat his impulse.

01:06:10.640 --> 01:06:14.670
Consumption is a unique impulse though.

01:06:15.800 --> 01:06:18.570
I can understand why Araya had his eyes on him.

01:06:21.580 --> 01:06:22.990
Look, Kokutou.

01:06:23.920 --> 01:06:31.500
If Lio Shirazumi has the origin of consumption, he must've been a predator in all his previous lives.

01:06:31.850 --> 01:06:35.910
When your origin awakens, you obtain all of your previous lives.

01:06:38.720 --> 01:06:44.070
You should consider Lio Shirazumi a group of beasts rather than a human being.

01:06:44.610 --> 01:06:48.180
It's fine while his personality as Lio Shirazumi remains,

01:06:48.180 --> 01:06:52.940
but he will really turn into a group of beasts once that disappears.

01:06:55.970 --> 01:06:58.810
That's interesting in its own way.

01:06:58.810 --> 01:07:01.990
The cause is that magus, right?

01:07:01.990 --> 01:07:04.240
He couldn't have done this himself.

01:07:04.630 --> 01:07:05.960
Oh really?

01:07:06.380 --> 01:07:12.620
The spell to awaken the origin is a secret spell that requires the caster and the target to consent.

01:07:13.390 --> 01:07:16.640
Lio Shirazumi chose it himself.

01:07:16.640 --> 01:07:22.670
He became a beast out of his own will, and he's killing people out of his own will.

01:07:23.060 --> 01:07:24.380
It's too late.

01:07:24.670 --> 01:07:29.230
So even you can't help Lio Shirazumi?

01:07:29.230 --> 01:07:33.230
Awakening of the origin is the final technique

01:07:33.230 --> 01:07:36.850
obtained by the man who tried to reach the origin through the soul.

01:07:37.670 --> 01:07:40.310
I specialize in physical bodies.

01:07:40.310 --> 01:07:42.700
There's nothing I can do about the soul.

01:07:44.130 --> 01:07:45.580
I see.

01:07:47.030 --> 01:07:53.040
But we may be able to do something for him now since his personality is still there, right?

01:07:53.350 --> 01:07:58.270
Well, we may be able to put him at peace,

01:07:58.770 --> 01:08:01.980
but there's no meaning in that.

01:08:01.980 --> 01:08:04.670
It's a miracle that he was able to stay as Lio Shirazumi until now.

01:08:06.760 --> 01:08:08.360
Good grief...

01:08:08.730 --> 01:08:12.010
I can see right through you, Kokutou.

01:08:12.290 --> 01:08:16.200
Well, I won't stop you, but he's a homicidal maniac.

01:08:16.660 --> 01:08:19.800
You can leave him to Shiki.

01:08:20.630 --> 01:08:25.190
She's after the homicidal maniac to get some closure for what happened four years ago, right?

01:08:25.940 --> 01:08:27.060
Touko.

01:08:27.390 --> 01:08:30.530
Why does a person kill another person?

01:08:31.310 --> 01:08:36.330
It's when the emotion you feel towards someone goes over your capacity.

01:08:38.680 --> 01:08:46.090
Be it love or hate, the emotion that spills out of your container has to be cleaned up one way or another.

01:08:46.310 --> 01:08:50.220
When this method becomes extreme, it becomes murder.

01:08:52.110 --> 01:08:55.010
But there are people who kill without that.

01:08:55.010 --> 01:08:57.850
That's not murder, that's slaughter.

01:08:58.970 --> 01:09:06.610
It only becomes murder when people put their dignity and their past on a scale and eliminate one.

01:09:06.610 --> 01:09:10.390
Then you bear the significance and the sin of killing someone.

01:09:10.390 --> 01:09:12.130
But slaughter is different.

01:09:12.510 --> 01:09:14.370
The one who was killed is human,

01:09:14.370 --> 01:09:17.620
but the one who killed lacks the dignity of a human and is no longer human.

01:09:19.050 --> 01:09:24.790
Killing someone means killing yourself.

01:09:26.070 --> 01:09:28.630
Then what is a homicidal maniac?

01:09:29.330 --> 01:09:31.330
It's just as it sounds.

01:09:32.280 --> 01:09:37.480
It's a maniac that kills people, so it's just like a natural disaster.

01:09:38.320 --> 01:09:41.010
Those who are involved with it are unlucky.

01:09:44.010 --> 01:09:45.650
Hey, Kokutou.

01:09:46.410 --> 01:09:50.030
People can only kill one person in their lifetime.

01:09:50.550 --> 01:09:52.700
I remember now.

01:09:54.870 --> 01:10:00.500
<i>She told me before that those were her grandfather's last words.</i>

01:10:00.930 --> 01:10:06.340
<i>Shiki has been trying to follow those words all this time, but she's about to lose it.</i>

01:10:07.000 --> 01:10:08.170
I'm sorry to have bothered you.

01:10:08.570 --> 01:10:09.750
Are you going?

01:10:09.750 --> 01:10:10.680
Yes.

01:10:10.680 --> 01:10:12.010
I see.

01:10:12.010 --> 01:10:15.030
Then I guess it'd be rude to stop you.

01:10:16.540 --> 01:10:18.680
Take care, Kokutou.

01:10:19.480 --> 01:10:22.440
If we're fated to do so, we'll see each other again tomorrow.

01:11:03.020 --> 01:11:04.460
Touko.

01:11:06.040 --> 01:11:07.790
Is my brother here?

01:11:08.870 --> 01:11:11.290
He's never home when I call him.

01:11:12.230 --> 01:11:14.190
Jeez, that Mikiya.

01:11:14.190 --> 01:11:16.410
He must be at that woman's place.

01:11:18.020 --> 01:11:20.160
Why don't you just go there?

01:11:20.710 --> 01:11:24.740
I don't want to do something that a loser would do.

01:11:24.740 --> 01:11:29.670
Can you tell him to cut his ties with that woman?

01:11:29.920 --> 01:11:31.990
Cut ties, huh?

01:11:32.360 --> 01:11:33.420
You're right.

01:11:33.420 --> 01:11:35.460
I've stayed here too long.

01:11:35.460 --> 01:11:39.430
This is unusual for me, but I think I really liked it too.

01:11:49.460 --> 01:11:52.810
Well, I'll start cleaning up.

01:11:53.290 --> 01:11:55.350
Are you going somewhere?

01:11:56.780 --> 01:11:57.840
Yeah.

01:13:30.360 --> 01:13:32.250
I grew them so carefully.

01:13:32.850 --> 01:13:34.960
What a waste.

01:14:22.650 --> 01:14:23.820
Kill me.

01:14:27.690 --> 01:14:32.930
Kill me and return to your true self.

01:14:33.520 --> 01:14:35.620
Shiki Ryougi.

01:14:36.110 --> 01:14:36.980
<i>I won't forgive you.</i>

01:14:54.500 --> 01:14:57.000
<i>I won't forgive you.</i>

01:14:58.750 --> 01:15:01.010
Kokutou!

01:15:28.890 --> 01:15:30.330
It's his fault.

01:15:34.870 --> 01:15:40.870
<i>He was Shiki and SHIKI's... Me and my other self's dream.</i>

01:15:41.630 --> 01:15:47.550
<i>It's just a painful dream that I'll never be able to have.</i>

01:16:00.460 --> 01:16:01.230
Why?

01:16:02.950 --> 01:16:05.290
It's so painful to be with you.

01:16:05.660 --> 01:16:12.030
You show me what I can never have, and it makes me so insecure.

01:16:13.050 --> 01:16:16.460
So I have to kill you.

01:16:19.280 --> 01:16:20.250
Shiki.

01:16:21.640 --> 01:16:23.210
I have to kill you!

01:16:24.860 --> 01:16:27.260
But I can't.

01:16:28.120 --> 01:16:31.760
You're our dream.

01:16:32.300 --> 01:16:33.370
Dream?

01:16:34.250 --> 01:16:36.550
If I can't make you go away,

01:16:37.540 --> 01:16:40.890
I have to make myself go away.

01:16:51.260 --> 01:16:52.410
<i>Thank you.</i>

01:16:53.690 --> 01:16:57.570
<i>I can't kill you.</i>

01:16:59.080 --> 01:17:02.870
<i>Those were the last words in SHIKI's mind.</i>

01:17:03.760 --> 01:17:07.540
<i>SHIKI, who was only able to concern himself with others through murder,</i>

01:17:07.540 --> 01:17:13.510
<i>could not even say those words to the one who he wanted to say them to.</i>

01:17:15.120 --> 01:17:20.830
<i>That's a little sad.</i>

01:17:33.480 --> 01:17:36.330
Oh, I'm still alive.

01:17:39.050 --> 01:17:44.180
<i>At that time, SHIKI died in my place.</i>

01:17:45.030 --> 01:17:48.820
<i>To protect his dream of living happily.</i>

01:17:53.940 --> 01:17:57.100
What part of me can you believe in?

01:17:59.510 --> 01:18:01.080
I don't have any basis,

01:18:02.110 --> 01:18:05.860
but I'll probably keep believing in you.

01:18:08.310 --> 01:18:11.320
I like you, so I want to keep believing in you.

01:18:17.070 --> 01:18:21.900
<i>Mikiya Kokutou, the form of a dream that SHIKI liked.</i>

01:18:22.650 --> 01:18:29.090
<i>That was the first emotion besides murder for SHIKI, who only knew of murder.</i>

01:18:30.070 --> 01:18:33.660
<i>It's so he could keep dreaming.</i>

01:18:34.590 --> 01:18:39.410
<i>So at the very least, I want him to remember SHIKI.</i>

01:18:40.250 --> 01:18:44.860
<i>I'm the dream SHIKI is watching.</i>

01:19:15.600 --> 01:19:17.080
Big brother...

01:19:32.240 --> 01:19:37.740
People kill someone at least once in their lifetime.

01:19:38.050 --> 01:19:45.000
We have one chance to allow ourselves to die.

01:19:46.070 --> 01:19:47.880
For yourself?

01:19:48.300 --> 01:19:53.390
They say it's "your life", but that doesn't mean that it belongs to you.

01:19:53.390 --> 01:19:55.420
Then what about you?

01:19:55.420 --> 01:19:57.890
I can't.

01:19:57.890 --> 01:20:00.890
I've killed many people already.

01:20:00.890 --> 01:20:06.920
No one would carry the burden of killing me. I would just go to an empty place.

01:20:06.920 --> 01:20:09.150
Only once?

01:20:09.590 --> 01:20:13.650
Yes. You can only kill someone once.

01:20:14.500 --> 01:20:23.120
The ones who killed someone else and used it up can never kill themselves.

01:20:23.120 --> 01:20:25.720
They can't die as a human.

01:20:26.160 --> 01:20:28.660
What's wrong, grandpa?

01:20:28.660 --> 01:20:30.770
Goodbye, Shiki.

01:20:30.770 --> 01:20:36.220
I hope that you can have a peaceful death.

01:20:36.580 --> 01:20:38.020
Grandpa?

01:20:38.020 --> 01:20:39.680
Hey, what's wrong?

01:20:42.880 --> 01:20:46.360
Hey, grandpa.

01:21:15.580 --> 01:21:18.260
I like that look in your eyes.

01:21:18.630 --> 01:21:22.300
Shiki Ryougi should be like that.

01:21:55.040 --> 01:21:58.070
I need you.

01:22:18.420 --> 01:22:23.440
You were unable to kill me again last night, and yet...

01:22:26.320 --> 01:22:29.480
You're more of a killer than I am.

01:22:36.830 --> 01:22:38.210
So why?

01:22:50.450 --> 01:22:54.100
Why haven't you killed once yet?

01:23:03.590 --> 01:23:08.040
It doesn't count if you kill someone inhuman like Araya.

01:23:16.430 --> 01:23:20.210
<i>What am I doing?</i>

01:23:22.410 --> 01:23:25.100
<i>If homicidal maniacs really exist,</i>

01:23:25.840 --> 01:23:28.590
<i>I'm not a homicidal maniac.</i>

01:23:30.590 --> 01:23:32.730
<i>I wanted to go back.</i>

01:23:33.540 --> 01:23:36.310
<i>I wanted to continue living my life with him there.</i>

01:23:37.250 --> 01:23:40.290
<i>I wanted to prove that I can live normally.</i>

01:23:43.320 --> 01:23:48.220
<i>That's why I had to settle things with the homicidal maniac.</i>

01:23:52.250 --> 01:23:53.560
<i>Everything...</i>

01:23:54.750 --> 01:23:56.590
<i>is his fault.</i>

01:24:01.930 --> 01:24:05.930
<i>I became weak because of him.</i>

01:24:08.980 --> 01:24:10.800
<i>I wouldn't have been like this</i>

01:24:11.530 --> 01:24:13.840
<i>if it wasn't for him.</i>

01:24:19.530 --> 01:24:20.600
<i>So...</i>

01:24:21.580 --> 01:24:24.070
<i>I can't even live</i>

01:24:24.820 --> 01:24:27.730
<i>without him.</i>

01:24:41.370 --> 01:24:43.890
How stupid.

01:25:09.250 --> 01:25:10.200
You mongrel.

01:25:31.890 --> 01:25:35.300
I'll suffer unless you come to this side.

01:25:56.190 --> 01:25:57.750
It's all right.

01:25:59.350 --> 01:26:03.920
I'll quickly eliminate the reason that's binding you.

01:26:52.290 --> 01:26:53.560
<i>This...</i>

01:26:54.430 --> 01:26:57.330
<i>isn't where I wanted to be.</i>

01:27:02.010 --> 01:27:06.100
<i>I have to go back quickly.</i>

01:27:08.910 --> 01:27:10.440
<i>To my house,</i>

01:27:11.580 --> 01:27:16.140
<i>to the place where I should return.</i>

01:27:22.600 --> 01:27:25.080
I told you not to look for me.

01:27:29.300 --> 01:27:31.710
That's why things ended up like this.

01:27:31.950 --> 01:27:33.100
Shirazumi.

01:27:36.900 --> 01:27:38.790
But I'm surprised.

01:27:38.790 --> 01:27:41.270
I didn't think you'd be so tough.

01:27:44.340 --> 01:27:50.450
The first guy I killed four years ago died after I only punched him once.

01:27:50.450 --> 01:27:52.650
Just after one punch.

01:27:54.900 --> 01:27:57.160
I should've punched you.

01:27:57.900 --> 01:28:02.240
I wouldn't have become a murderer if I had.

01:28:05.370 --> 01:28:07.820
But I'm happy too.

01:28:08.450 --> 01:28:12.920
You still looked for me.

01:28:13.240 --> 01:28:18.020
I know that you're Lio Shirazumi's ally.

01:28:18.020 --> 01:28:20.430
Giving you to Ryougi would be a waste.

01:28:20.810 --> 01:28:24.710
I just needed you to be my companion.

01:28:25.050 --> 01:28:26.810
You can't make companions.

01:28:27.480 --> 01:28:31.310
After all, your drugs never worked.

01:28:31.830 --> 01:28:35.950
I didn't think you knew that much, Kokutou.

01:28:36.480 --> 01:28:38.340
You're right.

01:28:38.340 --> 01:28:41.960
I wanted someone just like me.

01:28:41.960 --> 01:28:45.440
But, aside from Ryougi, people like that don't exist.

01:28:45.440 --> 01:28:48.460
So I have to make them artificially, right?

01:28:48.990 --> 01:28:52.980
I got the marijuana in this warehouse from Araya.

01:28:52.980 --> 01:28:56.020
It has a slightly different effect than other marijuana.

01:28:56.020 --> 01:29:01.220
It's poison that won't dissolve in your body. You won't develop any dependence or resistance.

01:29:01.220 --> 01:29:08.230
It's a drug that makes you high and will totally wipe away your sanity after a few dozen uses.

01:29:08.700 --> 01:29:13.480
Did you make the people who've done it that many times use the Bloodchip?

01:29:13.480 --> 01:29:17.260
No, that's for people who have potential.

01:29:17.750 --> 01:29:22.240
They're special, soaked in my blood.

01:29:23.100 --> 01:29:28.220
To some, it just worked like a drug. Others died because they couldn't bear it.

01:29:28.520 --> 01:29:32.470
If anyone had been able to bear it, they would've become my companion.

01:29:32.470 --> 01:29:36.350
So I was forced to dispose of corpses I didn't even want to consume.

01:29:36.720 --> 01:29:39.550
You must be the one who killed those four guys on Monday.

01:29:40.230 --> 01:29:43.160
Yeah. That pissed me off.

01:29:43.160 --> 01:29:48.640
I went through the trouble of making them attack her, but Ryougi didn't cross the line.

01:29:48.640 --> 01:29:52.410
It's all because you're binding Ryougi.

01:29:52.410 --> 01:29:57.580
Ultimately, as long as you're in that world, Ryougi won't come over here.

01:29:57.930 --> 01:30:02.120
So you either have to die or come to this world.

01:30:05.810 --> 01:30:06.850
Could it be?

01:30:07.150 --> 01:30:08.470
Could it be that Shiki...

01:30:08.470 --> 01:30:11.830
Worry about yourself before worrying about others.

01:31:01.090 --> 01:31:05.340
The dose you just swallowed is ten times more potent than marijuana.

01:31:07.170 --> 01:31:09.390
You'll die if you don't do something.

01:31:24.450 --> 01:31:26.280
Use this, Kokutou.

01:31:27.530 --> 01:31:31.540
Use it and come to this world yourself.

01:31:33.640 --> 01:31:36.540
And become special, just like me.

01:31:40.380 --> 01:31:41.590
What are you doing?

01:31:42.030 --> 01:31:44.470
You'll die if you don't use it.

01:32:02.050 --> 01:32:04.070
Take it, Mikiya!

01:32:10.400 --> 01:32:11.570
Mikiya!

01:32:14.920 --> 01:32:16.500
You'll die if you don't take it.

01:32:16.920 --> 01:32:20.420
Your body won't be able to handle the effects of the drug you just took.

01:32:21.020 --> 01:32:24.790
Die as a normal person or live as a special being.

01:32:24.790 --> 01:32:28.030
You shouldn't even need to think about which one's better.

01:32:30.020 --> 01:32:30.930
Why not?

01:32:38.290 --> 01:32:41.190
It doesn't seem fun.

01:32:44.270 --> 01:32:47.860
I prefer the "normal" you were talking about.

01:32:48.460 --> 01:32:52.580
I don't want to be special.

01:32:54.850 --> 01:32:56.570
You're not normal.

01:32:56.570 --> 01:32:58.720
You're weird, no matter how I think about it.

01:32:58.720 --> 01:33:01.080
You're the weird one, Shirazumi.

01:33:01.520 --> 01:33:04.350
You've lived being weird.

01:33:04.350 --> 01:33:09.210
You killed someone, so you looked away from your crime and ran away.

01:33:09.620 --> 01:33:14.210
You deceived yourself, saying that it's natural for an abnormal person to do something abnormal.

01:33:14.210 --> 01:33:15.430
Shut up.

01:33:16.770 --> 01:33:19.940
The name homicidal maniac was wrong.

01:33:20.490 --> 01:33:21.830
Shut up.

01:33:22.510 --> 01:33:26.560
You don't carry the same pain that Shiki does.

01:33:27.690 --> 01:33:30.120
You're not the same as Shiki.

01:33:30.600 --> 01:33:32.780
You're the complete opposite of her.

01:33:34.170 --> 01:33:39.010
You've killed people, but you can't confess to your own crimes.

01:33:39.890 --> 01:33:41.320
You're just running away.

01:33:41.320 --> 01:33:44.970
You can't become a murderer or a homicidal maniac.

01:33:46.710 --> 01:33:50.720
That's your true identity, Shirazumi.

01:33:50.720 --> 01:33:53.100
Shut up, Kokutou!

01:34:19.010 --> 01:34:21.330
This was for the best.

01:34:21.330 --> 01:34:24.230
She'll return to normal now.

01:35:06.210 --> 01:35:09.680
You bit your thumb off from the base?

01:35:15.040 --> 01:35:17.010
You're awesome.

01:35:17.480 --> 01:35:20.600
You're a perfect homicidal maniac.

01:35:25.270 --> 01:35:28.270
Now, let's go, Ryougi.

01:35:28.270 --> 01:35:32.150
I'll let you kill someone.

01:35:32.150 --> 01:35:34.610
Now, come on.

01:35:34.610 --> 01:35:35.160
Come on.

01:35:38.520 --> 01:35:41.750
Try someone else. I won't do it.

01:35:42.460 --> 01:35:44.210
What? But...

01:35:44.860 --> 01:35:48.500
I said before that I don't have time for you.

01:36:15.020 --> 01:36:17.660
Are you going to betray me too?

01:36:17.970 --> 01:36:20.200
I won't stand for that.

01:36:20.200 --> 01:36:26.560
Are you going to abandon me, who has killed for you and has done all this for you?

01:36:27.120 --> 01:36:31.380
I see. Are you going back to Mikiya's place, Ryougi?

01:36:38.220 --> 01:36:41.640
Then there's no need to leave.

01:36:41.640 --> 01:36:44.760
He's right here.

01:36:57.010 --> 01:36:59.600
Y-You...

01:37:04.040 --> 01:37:05.460
You can have that back.

01:37:05.460 --> 01:37:07.870
Sorry I got it dirty.

01:37:18.180 --> 01:37:22.470
Oh, so you died.

01:37:46.710 --> 01:37:48.810
I killed him.

01:37:48.810 --> 01:37:51.540
So that you can be set free.

01:37:51.540 --> 01:37:56.800
