You're correct that we're alike, but only in that one aspect.

01:39:05.670 --> 01:39:06.860
<i>Kokutou.</i>

01:39:08.420 --> 01:39:13.960
<i>I was happy just having you there, smiling.</i>

01:39:33.450 --> 01:39:38.720
<i>I was happy just having you there, walking with me.</i>

01:40:07.360 --> 01:40:11.900
<i>You smiled and said that we'd eventually be in the same place.</i>

01:40:16.470 --> 01:40:21.760
<i>I've always wanted someone to say those words to me.</i>

01:41:00.900 --> 01:41:09.280
<i>Those were really dreamlike days.</i>

01:41:16.550 --> 01:41:17.880
<i>Thank you.</i>

01:41:20.700 --> 01:41:23.390
<i>But I'm sorry.</i>

01:41:24.670 --> 01:41:27.610
<i>I know that I'll lose everything.</i>

01:41:28.160 --> 01:41:29.350
<i>But still...</i>

01:41:32.870 --> 01:41:33.850
<i>But still...</i>

01:41:35.870 --> 01:41:38.640
<i>I can't forgive him for killing you.</i>

01:42:58.730 --> 01:43:00.330
<i>I don't care now.</i>

01:43:01.520 --> 01:43:04.320
<i>I can't go home looking like this.</i>

01:43:05.800 --> 01:43:10.440
<i>You'd scold me if I went home covered in mud.</i>

01:43:22.100 --> 01:43:25.850
<i>But you'd still be waiting for me.</i>

01:43:27.550 --> 01:43:30.210
<i>I experienced those dreamy days,</i>

01:43:31.610 --> 01:43:35.360
<i>but now they seem so unreal.</i>

01:44:07.540 --> 01:44:09.170
Shiki...

01:44:12.290 --> 01:44:13.430
Shiki...

01:44:33.870 --> 01:44:34.930
Shiki.

01:44:40.450 --> 01:44:43.730
I won't forgive you if you kill Shirazumi.

01:44:44.160 --> 01:44:46.450
If you kill Shirazumi.

01:44:51.010 --> 01:44:53.810
I want you to be happy.

01:44:55.820 --> 01:44:58.340
I don't want you to be hurt anymore.

01:45:03.170 --> 01:45:04.470
I...

01:45:05.500 --> 01:45:07.220
I love you.

01:46:06.450 --> 01:46:07.530
Shiki.

01:46:51.730 --> 01:46:52.960
Shiki.

01:47:25.180 --> 01:47:26.430
<i>She's alive.</i>

01:47:38.550 --> 01:47:41.320
Are you crying, Kokutou?

01:47:49.650 --> 01:47:52.060
I killed Shirazumi.

01:47:52.850 --> 01:47:53.560
I see.

01:48:05.790 --> 01:48:08.410
I've lost a lot of things now.

01:48:09.010 --> 01:48:11.140
But I don't care.

01:48:12.850 --> 01:48:14.170
I told you, didn't I?

01:48:14.170 --> 01:48:16.510
I'll bear it in your place.

01:48:17.680 --> 01:48:18.420
<i>Yes.</i>

01:48:18.880 --> 01:48:23.150
<i>I swore to you when you first smiled at the end of summer.</i>

01:48:27.220 --> 01:48:30.290
<i>I said that I'll bear your sins in your place.</i>

01:48:31.000 --> 01:48:31.930
<i>So...</i>

01:48:32.740 --> 01:48:34.640
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

01:48:36.460 --> 01:48:42.980
<i>So you won't be alone until you die. Until the day you die.</i>

01:48:46.020 --> 01:48:48.430
But I'm a murderer.

01:48:51.290 --> 01:48:54.150
I told you that murder is wrong.

01:48:54.470 --> 01:48:56.440
But you couldn't abide by that.

01:48:56.440 --> 01:48:57.920
You're stupid.

01:48:58.830 --> 01:49:01.240
I'm angry this time.

01:49:02.010 --> 01:49:04.050
Crying won't get you out of trouble.

01:49:04.550 --> 01:49:08.680
Oh, so you won't forgive me even if I cry?

01:49:09.020 --> 01:49:10.200
No.

01:49:10.200 --> 01:49:12.470
You're not gonna fool me.

01:49:49.210 --> 01:49:49.970
Shiki.

01:50:00.300 --> 01:50:04.190
I won't ever let you go.

