01:56:42.160 --> 01:56:47.110
Sheesh... So you didn't come visit me? Not even once?

01:56:47.890 --> 01:56:50.210
Azaka got angry at me.

01:56:50.710 --> 01:56:54.070
When she says that she's going to kill me if I show up in your hospital room,

01:56:54.070 --> 01:56:56.000
then of course I don't wanna go.

01:56:56.000 --> 01:56:57.670
Guess you're excused then.

01:56:58.950 --> 01:57:00.530
Your left eye...

01:57:01.900 --> 01:57:04.170
Yeah, it won't heal.

01:57:09.630 --> 01:57:13.380
Shizune was right. Remember her?

01:57:13.380 --> 01:57:15.430
The girl who can see the future, right?

01:57:15.430 --> 01:57:16.700
I remember her.

01:57:16.700 --> 01:57:17.580
Yeah.

01:57:17.580 --> 01:57:22.840
She told me that I'll have an ill fate if I get involved with you.

01:57:23.240 --> 01:57:24.760
Her prediction was right.

01:57:24.760 --> 01:57:26.510
<i>Eye</i> literally did.

01:57:27.650 --> 01:57:29.260
Now what're you doing?

01:57:30.170 --> 01:57:31.340
What?

01:57:31.340 --> 01:57:33.060
I'm using you as my crutch.

01:57:33.720 --> 01:57:37.200
I'll need you to take care of me this week while I adjust.

01:57:39.560 --> 01:57:42.270
Why do I have to do this?

01:57:42.700 --> 01:57:44.300
Because I want you to.

01:57:45.040 --> 01:57:46.970
I won't make you if you don't want to.

01:57:49.070 --> 01:57:51.050
It's not like I don't want to.

01:57:51.860 --> 01:57:55.610
But I have school starting tomorrow.

01:57:55.980 --> 01:57:57.600
You can skip school.

01:57:57.600 --> 01:57:58.780
Hey now.

01:58:03.960 --> 01:58:08.180
You of all people telling me to skip school makes me laugh.

01:58:08.960 --> 01:58:11.310
You're so selfish.

01:58:13.580 --> 01:58:14.870
You're right.

01:58:15.400 --> 01:58:19.670
I've selfishly loved you since many years ago.

01:58:20.220 --> 01:58:21.200
Even now.

01:58:21.810 --> 01:58:26.430
That's why I've decided to selfishly meddle with you even if you don't like it.

01:58:30.240 --> 01:58:32.700
Oh, what's wrong, Shiki?

01:58:32.700 --> 01:58:34.540
You don't like words like those, right?

01:58:35.210 --> 01:58:38.150
You always told me that you don't like it.

01:58:38.790 --> 01:58:40.580
That's not true.

01:58:44.780 --> 01:58:46.400
Mikiya, that's why...

01:58:47.110 --> 01:58:51.740
I said that the current Shiki doesn't hate those things.

01:59:03.840 --> 01:59:05.850
Here, let's go.

01:59:07.890 --> 01:59:12.260
I didn't want a knife or anything,

01:59:12.260 --> 01:59:14.480
I just wanted this hand.

01:59:15.580 --> 01:59:20.870
I don't think I'll ever let go of this hand, no matter what may happen in the future.

01:59:22.210 --> 01:59:25.250
So my story ends here.

01:59:25.910 --> 01:59:33.310
I've accepted my current self and my previous self, and now I'll live my life.
